. I love the connection to nature.\nTim: Wow! That sounds amazing! The connection to nature must be incredible.\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_21\" date=\"5:34 pm on 6 December, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D21:3 D21:4\">\nTim: Wow! How long have you been playing professionally?\nJohn: I've been playing professionally for just under a year now. It's been a wild ride.\n</record>\n\nQuestion: What year did John start surfing?\n\nAnswer with the fact itself, as briefly as the question allows. Do not explain your reasoning. If the material above does not contain the answer, reply exactly: I don't know.\n\nAnswer:<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
