1.43.346.523 D slot launch_slot_: id  0 | task -1 | launching slot : {"id":0,"n_ctx":40960,"speculative":false,"is_processing":false,"id_task":907,"n_prompt_tokens":4536,"n_prompt_tokens_processed":4534,"n_prompt_tokens_cache":0,"params":{"seed":5005,"temperature":0.6000000238418579,"dynatemp_range":0.0,"dynatemp_exponent":1.0,"top_k":20,"top_p":0.949999988079071,"min_p":0.0,"top_n_sigma":-1.0,"xtc_probability":0.0,"xtc_threshold":0.10000000149011612,"typical_p":1.0,"repeat_last_n":64,"repeat_penalty":1.0,"presence_penalty":0.0,"frequency_penalty":0.0,"dry_multiplier":0.0,"dry_base":1.75,"dry_allowed_length":2,"dry_penalty_last_n":64,"dry_sequence_breakers":["\n",":","\"","*"],"mirostat":0,"mirostat_tau":5.0,"mirostat_eta":0.10000000149011612,"adaptive_target":-1.0,"adaptive_decay":0.8999999761581421,"stop":[],"max_tokens":4096,"n_predict":4096,"n_keep":0,"n_discard":0,"ignore_eos":false,"stream":false,"logit_bias":[],"n_probs":0,"min_keep":0,"grammar":"","grammar_lazy":false,"grammar_triggers":[],"preserved_tokens":[],"chat_format":"Content-only","reasoning_format":"none","reasoning_in_content":false,"generation_prompt":"","samplers":["penalties","dry","top_n_sigma","top_k","typ_p","top_p","min_p","xtc","temperature"],"speculative.types":"none","timings_per_token":false,"post_sampling_probs":false,"backend_sampling":false,"lora":[]},"next_token":[{"has_next_token":false,"has_new_line":false,"n_remain":4093,"n_decoded":3}],"prompt":"<|im_start|>user\nYou are answering a question about a conversation between two people.\n\nHere is what you remember of the conversation:\n\n<record session=\"session_1\" date=\"4:06 pm on 23 January, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D1:1 D1:2\">\nDeborah: Hey Jolene, nice to meet you! How's your week going? Anything fun happened?\nJolene: Hi Deb! Good to meet you! Yeah, my week's been busy. I finished an electrical engineering project last week - took a lot of work, but it's done now. Anything fun happening for you?\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_2\" date=\"9:49 am on 27 January, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D2:11 D2:12\">\nDeborah: This is one of the places where I do it.\nJolene: Where is it?\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_2\" date=\"9:49 am on 27 January, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D2:21 D2:22\">\nDeborah: Having a pet totally brightens up your life. It's great that it brings you comfort. Do you have any fun moments with your pet that you'd like to share?\nJolene:  I was playing video games and my pet just slinked out of her cage and coiled up next to me - it was too funny! My second snake Seraphim did it. Look at her sly eyes!\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_2\" date=\"9:49 am on 27 January, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D2:25 D2:26\">\nDeborah: Cool, Jolene! Pets bring so much happiness!\nJolene: They are very unusual pets! Here's me and my partner gaming last week - it's so fun. We played the game \"Detroit\" on the console. We are both crazy about this activity!\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_3\" date=\"7:03 pm on 1 February, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D3:5 D3:6\">\nJolene: How did you two meet?\nDeborah: It happened at yoga in the park.\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_4\" date=\"9:48 am on 4 February, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D4:15 D4:16\">\nJolene: Is it difficult to do?\nDeborah: Yes, but this brought us closer to Anna! We supported each other, that means a lot.\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_5\" date=\"9:03 pm on 9 February, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D5:1 D5:2\">\nJolene: Hey Deborah! Been a few days since we last talked so I wanted to fill you in on something cool. Last Wednesday I did a mini retreat to assess where I'm at in life. It was a dope experience that totally gave me a new outlook.\nDeborah: Hey Jolene! Sounds great. Taking time to reflect can be really awesome. Did you gain any new insights from it?\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_5\" date=\"9:03 pm on 9 February, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D5:11 D5:12\">\nJolene: No, not yet. I want to solidify the plan first. Can't wait to start reaching out, though!\nDeborah: That makes sense. I'm excited to hear how you reach out and help those kids. Let me know how it goes!\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_5\" date=\"9:03 pm on 9 February, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D5:17\">\nJolene: Stay safe!\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_6\" date=\"4:12 pm on 22 February, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D6:15 D6:16\">\nJolene: I'll keep you posted if I decide to go there.\nDeborah: Take care!\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_7\" date=\"4:50 pm on 25 February, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D7:5 D7:6\">\nJolene: He started joining me sometimes, which is nice for bonding and relaxing. It's brought us closer. This is just our random photo.\nDeborah: Aw, that's wonderful! How long have you been married?\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_8\" date=\"7:18 pm on 2 March, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D8:3 D8:4\">\nDeborah: Have you been able to find time for yourself lately?\nJolene: I've been trying to squeeze in some me-time. Last Friday, I did yoga and meditation to relax. Did you find time for yourself too?\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_8\" date=\"7:18 pm on 2 March, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D8:7 D8:8\">\nDeborah: Have you been able to get outside lately?\nJolene: I did take Seraphim to the park last Sunday. She loved it and here's a pic.\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_8\" date=\"7:18 pm on 2 March, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D8:9 D8:10\">\nDeborah: Looks like you guys had fun!\nJolene: We explored new places. People are surprised when they see a tamed snake. What do you like about being outdoors?\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_8\" date=\"7:18 pm on 2 March, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D8:23\">\nDeborah: Thanks, Jolene! Glad I could bring a smile to your face. Take care and make sure to give yourself some time to relax. Bye!\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_9\" date=\"11:22 am on 13 March, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D9:15 D9:16\">\nDeborah: Sure, Jolene. Let's find a time that works for both of us.\nJolene: Let's find a time to chat - I'll check my schedule and get back to you.\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_9\" date=\"11:22 am on 13 March, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D9:17 D9:18\">\nDeborah: Take your time, Jolene. We'll work it out. Take care of yourself, OK?\nJolene:  I'll make sure to take it. See you soon!\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_9\" date=\"11:22 am on 13 March, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D9:19 D9:20\">\nDeborah:  I'm here for you if you need me. Let's catch up soon.\nJolene: Have a great day!\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_13\" date=\"3:56 pm on 6 June, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D13:17 D13:18\">\nJolene: I've been doing them sporadically for about 3 years now and they've had a real positive effect on me.\nDeborah: Has it benefited you in any way? Have you found it helpful in difficult moments?\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_14\" date=\"9:17 am on 26 June, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D14:3 D14:4\">\nDeborah: By the way, I tried a new pose - Dancer Pose (Natarajasana). Rate, did I succeed?\nJolene: You are amazing as always! Here are new photos of Seraphim in the new aquarium that I bought the day before yesterday.\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_14\" date=\"9:17 am on 26 June, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D14:5 D14:6\">\nDeborah: Where'd you get it? I'm always drawn to animals, they bring so much joy. What's its story?\nJolene:  I got her last year, she's a great pet. She always cheers me up and brings a sense of peace. Spending time with her is so comforting.\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_14\" date=\"9:17 am on 26 June, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D14:13 D14:14\">\nDeborah: Awesome, Jolene! I'm really glad your project worked out. \nJolene: Stop talking about me, tell me more about your retreat.\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_14\" date=\"9:17 am on 26 June, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D14:21 D14:22\">\nDeborah: Yeah, we all need some peaceful time to relax.\nJolene: Gotta run, have a nice day!\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_15\" date=\"7:37 pm on 9 July, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D15:17 D15:18\">\nDeborah: Thanks, Jolene! Your support means a lot to me. I'm here for you too. By the way, I noticed your pet in the picture. What made you decide to get a snake?\nJolene:  I was fascinated by reptiles, and it felt like the perfect pet for me. Taking care of it has been really calming, and it's a great way to connect with nature.\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_15\" date=\"7:37 pm on 9 July, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D15:19 D15:20\">\nDeborah:  Glad you found something that gives you peace and calm. Do you have a favorite memory with \"it\" to share?\nJolene: I have lots of great memories, like our little 'snake adventure'. She got out and I spent hours searching, so relieved when I finally found her snuggling under the bed. It really showed how much I love her.\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_15\" date=\"7:37 pm on 9 July, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D15:25 D15:26\">\nDeborah: I haven't introduced you to my pets yet! I don't like dogs, that's why I have cats.\nJolene: Looks like they're having a blast! How often do you take them out?\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_15\" date=\"7:37 pm on 9 July, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D15:37 D15:38\">\nDeborah: Lucky you for having somewhere to relax and tune out!\nJolene: We'll definitely go there together sometime!\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_16\" date=\"9:26 am on 1 August, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D16:5 D16:6\">\nDeborah: They can really provide love and comfort, especially during tough times. How did you come to have Susie?\nJolene: I adopted her two years ago when I was feeling lonely and wanted some company.\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_18\" date=\"2:58 pm on 16 August, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D18:15\">\nJolene: Thanks, I'll hit you up if I need anything. Bye for now.\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_19\" date=\"12:52 am on 19 August, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D19:13 D19:14\">\nDeborah: We prefer to play detective games together.\nJolene: What other activities do you both enjoy doing together?\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_20\" date=\"9:11 am on 21 August, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D20:13 D20:14\">\nJolene: Gorgeous! Going for a walk and feeling so peaceful must be amazing.\nDeborah: Moments like that I'll always cherish.\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_20\" date=\"9:11 am on 21 August, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D20:23 D20:24\">\nJolene: I'm really finding my zen again!\nDeborah: Keep it up!\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_22\" date=\"5:33 pm on 26 August, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D22:21 D22:22\">\nDeborah: Max! They bring lots of joy and peace to our home.\nJolene: How did you get them?\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_23\" date=\"11:46 am on 30 August, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D23:1 D23:2\">\nJolene: Hey Deborah, how's it going? Guess what? Yesterday my partner and I got back from an awesome trip to Rio de Janeiro- we checked out some cool yoga classes.\nDeborah: That yoga pose looks great. Must've been a cool experience for the two of you. What did the trip teach you?\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_23\" date=\"11:46 am on 30 August, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D23:5 D23:6\">\nJolene: What was it like?\nDeborah: It brought back fond memories as I relaxed outside.\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_23\" date=\"11:46 am on 30 August, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D23:7 D23:8\">\nJolene: Sounds great! So glad you have a place to relax and find peace.\nDeborah: Thanks, Jolene. It's special for me. How about you? Is there a place that helps you relax?\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_23\" date=\"11:46 am on 30 August, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D23:9 D23:10\">\nJolene: I go to this nearby place to meditate by a tranquil spot.\nDeborah: Looks chill. What's been the effect of that?\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_23\" date=\"11:46 am on 30 August, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D23:17 D23:18\">\nJolene: We had a great time visiting an old temple. The stairs were amazing!\nDeborah: Wow, exploring those temples must have been incredible! Three years ago I was also in Rio de Janeiro, I took a beautiful photo on one of the excursions.\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_25\" date=\"8:31 pm on 6 September, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D25:11 D25:12\">\nJolene: What have you been doing lately?\nDeborah: I recently saw this wonderful sunrise again.\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_25\" date=\"8:31 pm on 6 September, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D25:17 D25:18\">\nJolene: Maybe one day we will be able to watch the sunrise together!\nDeborah: An offer I can't refuse!\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_26\" date=\"7:39 pm on 8 September, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D26:1 D26:2\">\nDeborah: Hey Jolene, had a tough week. Storm forced us to cancel our yoga getaway.\nJolene: Sorry to hear about it. How are you feeling now?\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_26\" date=\"7:39 pm on 8 September, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D26:11 D26:12\">\nDeborah: Sounds good, Jolene! When did you have in mind? That cafe rocks.\nJolene: How about Wednesday at 4? Can't wait to catch up over coffee!\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_27\" date=\"2:18 pm on 12 September, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D27:1 D27:2\">\nJolene: Hey Deb! So sorry for the late reply, been super busy. Last weekend my partner and I traveled to a meditation retreat for a few weeks in Phuket. Amazing experience! Nature, reflection and a break from engineering studies were awesome - it helped me find inner peace.\nDeborah:  I'd love to hear more about your reflections there and how they changed you.\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_27\" date=\"2:18 pm on 12 September, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D27:13\">\nJolene: I look forward to meeting you and playing this game!\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_28\" date=\"3:09 pm on 15 September, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D28:5 D28:6\">\nDeborah: Wow, it was so special. A glimpse into her life beyond what I knew. Through their eyes, I appreciate her more. Here I am and my mom.\nJolene: That looks like a blast! What did you and your mom's friends do on that day?\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_28\" date=\"3:09 pm on 15 September, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D28:25 D28:26\">\nDeborah: Hey, that's Susie or Seraphim? How long has he been hanging out with you?\nJolene: It`s Susie! I've had her for two years now. \n</record>\n<record session=\"session_29\" date=\"1:24 pm on 17 September, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D29:11 D29:12\">\nDeborah: Have you ever had something like that with someone close?\nJolene: I used to bake cookies with someone close to me.\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_29\" date=\"1:24 pm on 17 September, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D29:29 D29:30\">\nDeborah: Have you ever been interested in this or do you know nothing about it?\nJolene: Just started learning, but haven't gone yet. Want to come with me sometime?\n</record>\n<record session=\"session_30\" date=\"10:17 am on 20 September, 2023\" dialogue_ids=\"D30:9 D30:10\">\nDeborah: Are you planning to experience it again soon?\nJolene: Yeah! I'm planning to get out in nature again next month. It's going to be great reconnecting with it!\n</record>\n\nQuestion: When did Jolene take Seraphim to the park?\n\nAnswer with the fact itself, as briefly as the question allows. Do not explain your reasoning. If the material above does not contain the answer, reply exactly: I don't know.\n\nAnswer:<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
